# 与主仓 ruyi-workbench-oss 同口径：文本一律 LF，Windows 启动器是显式的 CRLF 例外。
* text=auto eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
# PowerShell 5.1 读无 BOM 的 UTF-8 会把中文读坏；本仓的 .ps1 一律 UTF-8 with BOM + CRLF。
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.wav binary
*.mp3 binary
*.png binary
